# Each declaration below falls outside geometric logic or would let the
# prover claim something false; `check` explains each (docs/geometric.md).

# A wrap that may be zero or negative no longer reads: wrap_at: takes a
# constant, worked out before any text is read.
Hours_Per_Day {Integer} (24)
Later_By {Integer} (5)

# 1. A claim about wrapped arithmetic. 'later' is not 'hour + Later_By': at
#    hour 20 it is 1. The prover bounds a wrapped field by [0, m) and cannot
#    prove it.
Clock {}
  hour {Integer} (0..23)
  later {Integer} (hour + Later_By) wrap_at: Hours_Per_Day
  ahead {Claims} (later >= hour)
